 "x1": 0.14505494505494507, "y1": 0.6511266511266511}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to your prescribed texts.", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.6736596736596736, "x1": 0.6571428571428571, "y1": 0.6868686868686869}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are listed on the following page.", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.7062937062937062, "x1": 0.5494505494505495, "y1": 0.7195027195027195}, {"text": "Question 1 (f) continues on page 5", "x0": 0.35604395604395606, "y0": 0.7466977466977467, "x1": 0.6461538461538462, "y1": 0.7599067599067599}], [{"text": "Question | (f) (continued)", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.09013209013209013, "x1": 0.33296703296703295, "y1": 0.10256410256410256}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.1383061383061383, "x1": 0.31978021978021975, "y1": 0.15151515151515152}, {"text": "\u2014 Sylvia Plath, Ariel", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.16161616161616163, "x1": 0.3010989010989011, "y1": 0.17482517482517482}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.19813519813519814, "x1": 0.33406593406593404, "y1": 0.21134421134421136}, {"text": "* Daddy", "x0": 0.12417582417582418, "y0": 0.22377622377622378, "x1": 0.1912087912087912, "y1": 0.236985236985237}, {"text": "* Nick and the Candlestick", "x0": 0.12417582417582418, "y0": 0.24164724164724163, "x1": 0.3395604395604396, "y1": 0.2517482517482518}, {"text": "* A Birthday Present", "x0": 0.12417582417582418, "y0": 0.2595182595182595, "x1": 0.2923076923076923, "y1": 0.2727272727272727}, {"text": "* Lady Lazarus", "x0": 0.12417582417582418, "y0": 0.27816627816627815, "x1": 0.24725274725274726, "y1": 0.2913752913752914}, {"text": "* Fever 103\"", "x0": 0.12417582417582418, "y0": 0.29526029526029524, "x1": 0.22637362637362637, "y1": 0.3061383061383061}, {"text": "* The Arrival of the Bee Box", "x0": 0.12417582417582418, "y0": 0.3139083139083139, "x1": 0.35274725274725277, "y1": 0.3271173271173271}, {"text": "and", "x0": 0.17582417582417584, "y0": 0.33255633255633255, "x1": 0.2043956043956044, "y1": 0.34265734265734266}, {"text": "\u2014 Ted Hughes, Birthday Letters", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.3504273504273504, "x1": 0.3912087912087912, "y1": 0.36363636363636365}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.15274725274725276, "y0": 0.38694638694638694, "x1": 0.3637362637362637, "y1": 0.40015540015540013}, {"text": "* Fulbright Scholars", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.41181041181041184, "x1": 0.31978021978021975, "y1": 0.425019425019425}, {"text": "* The Shot", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.4296814296814297, "x1": 0.23846153846153847, "y1": 0.4397824397824398}, {"text": "* A Picture of Otto", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.445998445998446, "x1": 0.3054945054945055, "y1": 0.4592074592074592}, {"text": "* Fever", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.46231546231546233, "x1": 0.21428571428571427, "y1": 0.47241647241647244}, {"text": "* Red", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.47863247863247865, "x1": 0.1989010989010989, "y1": 0.4887334887334887}, {"text": "* The Bee God", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.494949494949495, "x1": 0.27362637362637365, "y1": 0.5050505050505051}, {"text": "End of Question 1 (f)", "x0": 0.41208791208791207, "y0": 0.5773115773115773, "x1": 0.5901098901098901, "y1": 0.5905205905205905}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.4868131868131868, "y0": 0.6192696192696193, "x1": 0.5164835164835165, "y1": 0.6285936285936286}, {"text": "Please turn over", "x0": 0.432967032967033, "y0": 0.6596736596736597, "x1": 0.5714285714285714, "y1": 0.668997668997669}], [{"text": "Question 1 (g) \u2014 Shakespearean Drama and Prose Fiction (20 marks)", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.09013209013209013, "x1": 0.7153846153846154, "y1": 0.10334110334110334}, {"text": "between Atwood\u2019s", "x0": 0.7153846153846154, "y0": 0.12198912198912198, "x1": 0.865934065934066, "y1": 0.1320901320901321}, {"text": "\u201cSeven years after the publication of Hag-Seed, the textual", "x0": 0.12417582417582418, "y0": 0.12198912198912198, "x1": 0.5934065934065934, "y1": 0.1351981351981352}, {"text": "novel and The Tempest still resonate with contemporary values and di", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.13908313908313907, "x1": 0.6791208791208792, "y1": 0.1522921522921523}, {"text": "urse.\u201d", "x0": 0.7131868131868132, "y0": 0.13986013986013987, "x1": 0.756043956043956, "y1": 0.14918414918414918}, {"text": "To what extent is this statement true of the two prescribed texts you have studied in Module", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.17094017094017094, "x1": 0.8626373626373627, "y1": 0.18414918414918416}, {"text": "A?", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.18803418803418803, "x1": 0.14505494505494507, "y1": 0.19735819735819735}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to the extract below and your prescribed texts.", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.2198912198912199, "x1": 0.8351648351648352, "y1": 0.2331002331002331}, {"text": "\u201cThere. That\u2019s our report. Antonio acts like what youd expect him to do,", "x0": 0.24175824175824176, "y0": 0.26884226884226886, "x1": 0.8252747252747252, "y1": 0.28205128205128205}, {"text": "and Prospero doesn\u2019t see it coming because he never saw it coming the first", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.28826728826728826, "x1": 0.8263736263736263, "y1": 0.3014763014763015}, {"text": "time, We know this is not a nice ending for a lot of the people in this play,", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.29836829836829837, "x1": 0.8252747252747252, "y1": 0.3247863247863248}, {"text": "but we wanted to tell the truth in some kind of real way, and this is what it\u2019s", "x0": 0.21428571428571427, "y0": 0.32556332556332557, "x1": 0.8263736263736263, "y1": 0.33877233877233875}, {"text": "like, this is what happens. Antonio is evil, what d\u2019you expect? Thanks, guys,\u201d", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.3442113442113442, "x1": 0.8263736263736263, "y1": 0.35742035742035744}, {"text": "he says to the rest of Team Antonio, \u201cfor helping us stick to life the way it", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.36363636363636365, "x1": 0.8263736263736263, "y1": 0.37684537684537683}, {"text": "is, no sugar-coating,\u201d With the same defiant swagger, he returns to his seat.", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.3822843822843823, "x1": 0.8252747252747252, "y1": 0.3954933954933955}, {"text": "s is silent [...]", "x0": 0.2868131868131868, "y0": 0.40093240093240096, "x1": 0.3945054945054945, "y1": 0.41414141414141414}, {"text": "s harsh,\u201d says Anne-Marie.", "x0": 0.2703296703296703, "y0": 0.4195804195804196, "x1": 0.4868131868131868, "y1": 0.43278943278943277}, {"text": "\u201cYeah. Life is harsh,\u201d says SnakeEye.", "x0": 0.24175824175824176, "y0": 0.4382284382284382, "x1": 0.5461538461538461, "y1": 0.45143745143745145}, {"text": "\u201cT think Team Antonio deserves full marks,\u201d says Felix to the room.", "x0": 0.24175824175824176, "y0": 0.45765345765345766, "x1": 0.8252747252747252, "y1": 0.47086247086247085}, {"text": "\u201cDon\u2019t you?\u201d", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.47707847707847706, "x1": 0.3230769230769231, "y1": 0.48951048951048953}, {"text": "Nods and murmurs. The rest of them don\u2019t like thi", "x0": 0.24175824175824176, "y0": 0.494949494949495, "x1": 0.6406593406593407, "y1": 0.5050505050505051}, {"text": "tory: it\u2019s not a happy", "x0": 0.6626373626373626, "y0": 0.494949494949495, "x1": 0.8263736263736263, "y1": 0.5081585081585082}, {"text": "ending, and it contains no redemption. But all things considered they have to", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.5143745143745144, "x1": 0.8263736263736263, "y1": 0.5275835275835276}, {"text": "agree.", "x0": 0.2153846153846154, "y0": 0.5361305361305362, "x1": 0.26153846153846155, "y1": 0.5462315462315462}, {"text": "(from Hag-Seed)", "x0": 0.6901098901098901, "y0": 0.5516705516705517, "x1": 0.8263736263736263, "y1": 0.5648795648795649}, {"text": "The prescribed texts are:", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.5874125874125874, "x1": 0.31978021978021975, "y1": 0.6006216006216006}, {"text": "\u2014 William Shakespeare, The Tempest", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6091686091686092, "x1": 0.43736263736263736, "y1": 0.6223776223776224}, {"text": "and", "x0": 0.17582417582417584, "y0": 0.6278166278166278, "x1": 0.2043956043956044, "y1": 0.6379176379176379}, {"text": "\u2014 Margaret Atwood, Hag-Seed", "x0": 0.12197802197802197, "y0": 0.6456876456876457, "x1": 0.3868131868131868, "y1": 0.6588966588966589}, {"text": "End of Section I", "x0": 0.43626373626373627, "y0": 0.7008547008547008, "x1": 0.5725274725274725, "y1": 0.7101787101787101}, {"text": "-6-", "x0": 0.4857142857142857, "y0": 0.9456099456099456, "x1": 0.5175824175824176, "y1": 0.9549339549339549}], [{"text": "Section II \u2014- Module B: Critical Study of Literature", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.09090909090909091, "x1": 0.6318681318681318, "y1": 0.10567210567210568}, {"text": "20 marks", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.12665112665112666, "x1": 0.2021978021978022, "y1": 0.13597513597513597}, {"text": "Attempt ONE question from Questions 2 (a) 2 (I)", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.14374514374514374, "x1": 0.554945054945055, "y1": 0.1561771561771562}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.16006216006216006, "x1": 0.45604395604395603, "y1": 0.16938616938616938}, {"text": "Answer the question in a SEPARATE writing booklet. Clearly mark the Question you are", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.19658119658119658, "x1": 0.8461538461538461, "y1": 0.2097902097902098}, {"text": "attempting. Extra writing booklets are available.", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.2128982128982129, "x1": 0.5098901098901099, "y1": 0.2261072261072261}, {"text": "Your answer will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.14725274725274726, "y0": 0.24786324786324787, "x1": 0.5274725274725275, "y1": 0.26107226107226106}, {"text": "\u00a9 demonstrate an informe