x0": 0.48021978021978023, "y0": 0.9456099456099456, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.9549339549339549}], [{"text": "Section III \u2014 Module C: The Craft of Writing", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.09090909090909091, "x1": 0.5879120879120879, "y1": 0.10567210567210568}, {"text": "20 marks", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.12665112665112666, "x1": 0.2021978021978022, "y1": 0.13597513597513597}, {"text": "Attempt Question 3", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.14374514374514374, "x1": 0.29010989010989013, "y1": 0.1561771561771562}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.16161616161616163, "x1": 0.45604395604395603, "y1": 0.17094017094017094}, {"text": "Answer the question ina SEPARATE writing booklet. Extra writing booklets are available.", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.19425019425019424, "x1": 0.8593406593406593, "y1": 0.20745920745920746}, {"text": "Your answer will be ass", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.22921522921522922, "x1": 0.34175824175824177, "y1": 0.23931623931623933}, {"text": "ed on how well you:", "x0": 0.37142857142857144, "y0": 0.22921522921522922, "x1": 0.5340659340659341, "y1": 0.24242424242424243}, {"text": "\u00a9 Craft language to address the demands of the question", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.2400932400932401, "x1": 0.6186813186813187, "y1": 0.2665112665112665}, {"text": "\u00a9 Use language appropriate to audience, purpose and context to deliberately shape", "x0": 0.15384615384615385, "y0": 0.26573426573426573, "x1": 0.8296703296703297, "y1": 0.2789432789432789}, {"text": "meaning", "x0": 0.1835164835164835, "y0": 0.28205128205128205, "x1": 0.25164835164835164, "y1": 0.29526029526029524}, {"text": "Question 3 (20 marks)", "x0": 0.12307692307692308, "y0": 0.32245532245532244, "x1": 0.321978021978022, "y1": 0.3372183372183372}, {"text": "Yet another student asked everyone if they had heard what was happening in", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.3581973581973582, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.3714063714063714}, {"text": "Sydney and read out a tweet she\u2019d read that morning by a writer who lived", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.3745143745143745, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.3877233877233877}, {"text": "there.", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.3916083916083916, "x1": 0.2703296703296703, "y1": 0.4017094017094017}, {"text": "Time has never meant less. The Gregorian calendar is a guidebook to the", "x0": 0.2879120879120879, "y0": 0.40714840714840717, "x1": 0.8417582417582418, "y1": 0.41802641802641805}, {"text": "lost city of Atlantis. All around is the end of possibilty. We go through the", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.4211344211344211, "x1": 0.8406593406593407, "y1": 0.432012432012432}, {"text": "\u2018motions, never going anywhere. Glaciers melt, we are frozen. Time is stuck.", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.43434343434343436, "x1": 0.8373626373626374, "y1": 0.44522144522144524}, {"text": "(Rick Morton, 2021)", "x0": 0.6945054945054945, "y0": 0.4553224553224553, "x1": 0.8406593406593407, "y1": 0.4662004662004662}, {"text": "New strains, dying forests, dying oceans, catastrophic floods, heat bubbles,", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.48329448329448327, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.4965034965034965}, {"text": "disappearing glaciers, collapsing ice sheets, talk of war, actual war. Would it", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.4996114996114996, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.5128205128205128}, {"text": "ever stop? It would never stop.", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.5167055167055167, "x1": 0.4736263736263736, "y1": 0.5299145299145299}, {"text": "Extract from This Devastating Fever", "x0": 0.5560439560439561, "y0": 0.5493395493395493, "x1": 0.8516483516483516, "y1": 0.5625485625485626}, {"text": "SOPHIE CUNNINGHAM", "x0": 0.676923076923077, "y0": 0.5664335664335665, "x1": 0.8505494505494505, "y1": 0.5757575757575758}, {"text": "(a) Use this extract as a stimulus for a piece of discursive writing that uses the natural 10", "x0": 0.13516483516483516, "y0": 0.6161616161616161, "x1": 0.9120879120879121, "y1": 0.6293706293706294}, {"text": "world as a setting.", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6332556332556333, "x1": 0.3263736263736264, "y1": 0.6464646464646465}, {"text": "Note: You are NOT required to write out the extract as part of your response.", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.6658896658896659, "x1": 0.8032967032967033, "y1": 0.679098679098679}, {"text": "(b) Evaluate how your study of writing style in The Craft of Writing influenced the 10", "x0": 0.13406593406593406, "y0": 0.7148407148407149, "x1": 0.9230769230769231, "y1": 0.728049728049728}, {"text": "creative decisions you made in part (a)", "x0": 0.1813186813186813, "y0": 0.7311577311577312, "x1": 0.49230769230769234, "y1": 0.7443667443667443}, {"text": "In your response, make reference to one or more of your prescribed texts.", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.7645687645687645, "x1": 0.7714285714285715, "y1": 0.7777777777777778}, {"text": "End of paper", "x0": 0.4461538461538462, "y0": 0.8313908313908314, "x1": 0.5571428571428572, "y1": 0.8438228438228438}, {"text": "-ll-", "x0": 0.48021978021978023, "y0": 0.9456099456099456, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.9549339549339549}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.43846153846153846, "y0": 0.351981351981352, "x1": 0.5637362637362637, "y1": 0.3620823620823621}, {"text": "-12-", "x0": 0.48021978021978023, "y0": 0.9456099456099456, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.9549339549339549}]]